## Utility

Utility: Gas / Fee Payment
Deskripsi: Token MOVE direncanakan digunakan untuk pembayaran gas fee di M1 L2 dan Movement Network (native gas token untuk MoveVM/MEVM execution)
Status: Planned
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Utility: Staking / Validator Security
Deskripsi: Token MOVE direncanakan digunakan untuk staking oleh validator/sequencer dalam decentralized sequencer set untuk M1 dan Movement Network (economic security)
Status: Planned
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Utility: Governance
Deskripsi: Token MOVE direncanakan memberikan voting power untuk governance protokol (parameter upgrades, treasury allocation, DA layer selection, dll)
Status: Planned
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Utility: Incentive / Reward
Deskripsi: Token MOVE direncanakan untuk incentive program: developer grants, liquidity mining, testnet incentives (Parthenon), ecosystem growth
Status: Planned
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/

Utility: DA Layer Payment
Deskripsi: Token MOVE berpotensi digunakan untuk pembayaran DA layer fees (Celestia, Avail, EigenDA) melalui DA adapter di Movement Network
Status: Planned
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Utility: Cross-chain Messaging / Bridge Fees
Deskripsi: Token MOVE berpotensi digunakan untuk fee cross-chain messaging dalam Movement Network coordinator
Status: Planned
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

